    {
      id: "about",
      label: "About",
      icon: "info",
      type: "content",
      markdown: [
        {
          title: "Overview",
          content: [
            "GeoPNG Dataview is a high-performance geospatial raster visualizer powered by deck.gl and WebGL. It delivers real-time 2D/3D rendering of high-resolution single-band and multi-temporal geospatial datasets directly in the browser with zero server latency.",
          ],
        },
        {
          title: "Projections & 3D Terrain",
          content: [
            "> [!WARNING]",
            "We need support for warnings/notes and the like.",
            "- **Web Mercator**: Standard tiled and planar projection.",
            "- **3D Interactive Globe**: Full spherical rendering with altitude displacement.",
            "- **Equirectangular & Equal Earth**: True equal-area cylindrical and pseudocylindrical projections.",
            "- **3D Needle Spikes**: Extruded terrain columns with dynamic exponential scaling.",
            "- **Equal-Area Circles**: High-value proportional circle overlays.",
          ],
        },
        {
          title: "Analytical Engine",
          content: [
            "Integrated ECharts analytical distributions, interactive percentile breakpoint adjustment, and instant multi-country statistical mask calculations.",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      id: "policy",
      label: "Policy",
      icon: "gavel",
      type: "content",
      markdown: [
        {
          title: "We have no policy!",
